      "content": "i mean i get that but i dont really have time to go to the doctor right now and i'm pretty sure its just a pulled muscle or something pretty minor. i've seen people online do these deep spinal twists and they say it feels way better immediately. isn't it kinda better to just work through the tension so it doesnt stiffen up? like, if i just do some intense yoga stretches it might fix it faster than waiting for an appointment?",
